sentences.text:
This order will remain operative subject to compliance of the following conditions by the applicant:-
1. The applicants will comply with all the terms and conditions of the bond executed by them;
2. The applicants will cooperate in the investigation/ trial, as the case may be;
3.

The applicants will not indulge themselves in extending inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of the case so as to dissuade them from disclosing such facts to the Court or to the Police Officer, as the case may be.
4. The applicants shall not commit any offence similar to the offence of which they are accused;
5. The applicants will not seek unnecessary adjournments during the trial;
Ramsewak Singh Gurjar vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 6 October, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/153054509/
2 6.

